## Model card

- **Name:** Nemotron 3.5 Bolt E4B
- **Short description:** NVIDIA's announced ~4GB-class edge model for fast conversational and physical agents on GeForce RTX, Jetson and RTX/DGX Spark. Scheduled for release 2026-10-23; no weights, specs or benchmarks published yet.
- **Provider / access:** Not released. Expected open weights under the Bolt family (OpenMDW-1.1) once shipped; no Hugging Face repo resolves yet.
- **Release / knowledge:** Announced 2026-10-15; scheduled release 2026-10-23.
- **IDs:** none resolve yet (`opencode/nemotron-3.5-bolt-e4b` is a tracked placeholder).
- **Context window:** Not published.
- **Modalities:** text in/out expected (voice implied by positioning, not specified).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-21):** Not published; Bolt-family open weights expected to be self-host-free.
- **Architecture:** undisclosed; the sibling Bolt 74B-A9B uses a Mamba-2–Transformer hybrid LatentMoE with a C-RADIO v4-H vision encoder — not confirmed for E4B.

